diculous truth: a cheerful delivery worker is pushing a small metal delivery trolley with a flat cardboard T-Rex advertising cutout attached upright to it. A low work light behind the cutout projects its enormous dinosaur silhouette onto the distant wall. The rattling sound comes from the trolley's wheels. As the trolley moves, the giant shadow moves with the cardboard dinosaur. The real object is small, harmless and clearly visible.\n\n00:11–00:15 — The delivery worker stops, smiles at the terrified office worker and says in natural Mandarin: <d>[Chinese] 先生，您的外卖到了！</d> The office worker looks between the tiny cardboard dinosaur and its gigantic wall shadow, then slowly slides down against the pillar in exhausted disbelief. He gives one awkward, embarrassed laugh while still holding the food bag. The delivery worker remains cheerfully confused. End with the small cardboard dinosaur and enormous shadow visible together in the background.\n\nOne continuous camera movement with no hard cuts. All actions happen at realistic normal speed, 24fps playback with no slow motion. The giant dinosaur exists only as the shadow of the cardboard advertising prop, never as a real monster. Physically correct projected shadow direction and scale, stable character identity, natural hand movements, believable lighting and consistent parking garage geometry. No morphing, teleportation, duplicated people, subtitles or additional dialogue.\n\noverall_soundscape:\nCold fluorescent electrical hum, distant water dripping, ominous low rumbling, rolling metal trolley wheels that initially resemble heavy footsteps, crinkling food packaging, nervous breathing, a realistic delivery-worker male Mandarin voice, then an embarrassed laugh. The sound perspective changes naturally as the trolley becomes visible.\n\nnon_diegetic_music:\nA quiet original horror-style low drone and sparse tense percussion during the opening. At the delivery-trolley reveal, the frightening music cuts off abruptly. A very short, playful comedic musical sting underscores the final embarrassed expression.\n"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "value"}, "name": "value", "label": "value", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "value"}], "flags": {}, "type": "PrimitiveStringMultiline", "title": "Input Text (Prompt)", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#533", "size": [360, 480], "pos": [-1501.9777930965208, 4247.374738930747], "id": 138, "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.33.0", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.8"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "PrimitiveStringMultiline"}, "order": 9, "widgets_values_named": {"value": "\nFor the target video, at 0.00 seconds into the target video, <Picture 1> (from [Shot 1]) is fully referenced.\n\nintegrated_multimodal_description:\n[Shot 1] Photorealistic live-action cinematic suspense comedy. Begin exactly from <Picture 1>. Inside a dim underground parking garage with wet reflective concrete floors, parked cars, overhead pipes, cold fluorescent lights and a large dinosaur-shaped shadow on the far concrete wall, a young East Asian office worker in a wrinkled white shirt, loosened black tie and dark trousers hides behind a concrete pillar while clutching a takeaway food bag. Preserve the exact man, clothing, location, lighting, wall shadow and camera composition from the reference image.\n\n00:00–00:03 — Medium-wide shot. The man stares at the gigantic T-Rex-shaped shadow on the far wall, terrified. His eyes widen, his shoulders rise, and he presses his back against the pillar. A deep, ominous rumbling sound echoes through the parking garage. The shadow seems to move slightly across the wall.\n\n00:03–00:07 — The camera slowly tracks right from the man's hiding place, maintaining the parking garage's real spatial layout. The huge dinosaur-shaped shadow shifts across the wall. Heavy rhythmic rattling noises grow closer. The man crouches lower, accidentally crinkles his takeaway bag